# Experimental Results and Performance Analysis

## Performance Indicators

The experimental evaluation considered the following 5G NR performance indicators:

- RSRP
- RSRQ
- SINR
- CQI
- BLER
- RI
- MCS
- Throughput

## Experimental Comparisons

The project evaluated the impact of radio configuration parameters on link performance.

Measurements were compared with theoretical estimates, including:

- Friis transmission equation.
- SINR-to-CQI mapping.
- Bitrate estimation based on TDD slot allocation.

## Results Documentation

This section contains the experimental graphs, measurement tables and technical interpretation of the results.

Each result should identify the test configuration, propagation conditions and transmission direction.
